    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 As members of the Vanguard,  defend your home from invading gods in this action-packed brawler set in the world of Valdis Story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/b0655c4b88d33fddec2214492e1b3c5f.poster.avif?t=1738355482\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/b0655c4b88d33fddec2214492e1b3c5f.webm?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/b0655c4b88d33fddec2214492e1b3c5f.mp4?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customize your character in each playthrough with over 80 unique items and skills. Go head to head with invading gods in intense boss battles alone, with a CPU partner, or up to 4 players in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/8dffd375d2b4dd48bdf39f2ee67c3d87.poster.avif?t=1738355482\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/8dffd375d2b4dd48bdf39f2ee67c3d87.webm?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/8dffd375d2b4dd48bdf39f2ee67c3d87.mp4?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Reina, Goddess of Death, has been shielding Erebus from invading gods for decades, but their numbers have become overwhelming, and foreign gods are slipping through her barrier, aided by traitorous cultists. Each god slain brings you closer to the dark truth behind the invasions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 As members of the Vanguard,  defend your home from invading gods in this action-packed brawler set in the world of Valdis Story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/b0655c4b88d33fddec2214492e1b3c5f.poster.avif?t=1738355482\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/b0655c4b88d33fddec2214492e1b3c5f.webm?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/b0655c4b88d33fddec2214492e1b3c5f.mp4?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customize your character in each playthrough with over 80 unique items and skills. Go head to head with invading gods in intense boss battles alone, with a CPU partner, or up to 4 players in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/8dffd375d2b4dd48bdf39f2ee67c3d87.poster.avif?t=1738355482\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/8dffd375d2b4dd48bdf39f2ee67c3d87.webm?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359390/extras/8dffd375d2b4dd48bdf39f2ee67c3d87.mp4?t=1738355482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Reina, Goddess of Death, has been shielding Erebus from invading gods for decades, but their numbers have become overwhelming, and foreign gods are slipping through her barrier, aided by traitorous cultists. Each god slain brings you closer to the dark truth behind the invasions.</p>",
